    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 010000000100000001000000020000000200000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "~~~I don\u2019t think I know anymore."
    displayText: "I don\u2019t think I know anymore."
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: -1567119930, guid: e03e9e6f15669634cafbbe8d217c2db2, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.06
    dialogueType: 3
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: ~~~.$$$.$$$.
    displayText: ...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 674674170, guid: e166fccd4362c7844accca5d43e8cac0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.06
    dialogueType: 3
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 010000000100000001000000020000000200000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: ~~~I keep replaying those moments again and again.
    displayText: I keep replaying those moments again and again.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: -1567119930, guid: e03e9e6f15669634cafbbe8d217c2db2, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.06
    dialogueType: 3
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: ~~~Trying to fix it.
    displayText: Trying to fix it.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: -1567119930, guid: e03e9e6f15669634cafbbe8d217c2db2, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.06
    dialogueType: 3
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: ~~~To see whose fault it actually is.
    displayText: To see whose fault it actually is.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: -1567119930, guid: e03e9e6f15669634cafbbe8d217c2db2, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.06
    dialogueType: 3
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: ~~~But the more I think about it.$$.$$.$$ the less alone I am.
    displayText: But the more I think about it... the less alone I am.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: -142652558, guid: e03e9e6f15669634cafbbe8d217c2db2, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.06
    dialogueType: 3
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1e0000001e0000001f0000001f0000002000000020000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: ~~~About what?
    displayText: About what?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 674674170, guid: e166fccd4362c7844accca5d43e8cac0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.06
    dialogueType: 3
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: ~~~Everything.
    displayText: Everything.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: -142652558, guid: e03e9e6f15669634cafbbe8d217c2db2, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.06
    dialogueType: 3
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: ~~~.$$$.$$$.$$$
    displayText: ...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 674674170, guid: e166fccd4362c7844accca5d43e8cac0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.06
    dialogueType: 3
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 010000000100000001000000020000000200000002000000030000000300000003000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: ~~~I'm still not sure what the whole truth is$$$$, but maybe.$$.$$.$$$$$
    displayText: I'm still not sure what the whole truth is, but maybe...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: -1567119930, guid: e03e9e6f15669634cafbbe8d217c2db2, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.06
    dialogueType: 3
    typeSound: speak
